00:56:10.700 --> 00:56:12.300
I’d rather kill myself.

00:56:12.500 --> 00:56:14.000
Why not do both?

00:56:14.200 --> 00:56:15.800
Oh. Very well.

00:56:19.800 --> 00:56:22.900
I may as well jump

00:56:23.000 --> 00:56:24.800
Those sIeazy naked scammers

00:56:24.900 --> 00:56:27.100
Made me Iook like a chump

00:56:27.200 --> 00:56:31.100
They robbed me of my dignity
and most of my stuff

00:56:31.200 --> 00:56:33.100
Lars brought me candy

00:56:33.200 --> 00:56:35.500
Cram it down and shut the hell up

00:56:35.600 --> 00:56:38.400
I can't compete with that

00:56:39.600 --> 00:56:43.200
He's Barbados Slim and I'm Jamaican fat

00:56:43.300 --> 00:56:47.100
Who wouId choose a backwards corpse
with lice in his hair?

00:56:47.200 --> 00:56:49.200
Lars says I'm dreamy

00:56:49.300 --> 00:56:50.700
Who the hell cares?

00:56:50.800 --> 00:56:54.500
Oh, won't somebody shoot her, please

00:56:54.600 --> 00:56:57.600
And put her out of our misery?

00:56:57.700 --> 00:56:58.900
That's my cue.

00:57:12.300 --> 00:57:13.700
Oh, my word.

00:57:15.900 --> 00:57:17.800
Lars makes me puke

00:57:19.200 --> 00:57:22.700
I bet she'd Iove me, too
If I was a baIdheaded kook

00:57:22.800 --> 00:57:24.700
- Hey, guess what, guys!
- What?

00:57:24.800 --> 00:57:27.200
While we were huddIed in fear

00:57:27.300 --> 00:57:29.000
Lars popped the question

00:57:29.100 --> 00:57:31.100
- Congratulations!
- Mazel tov!

00:57:31.200 --> 00:57:33.100
May stars in heaven bless your love!

00:57:33.200 --> 00:57:34.600
I think I'm gonna cry

00:57:34.700 --> 00:57:38.300
'cause it's
an extra happy Xmas this year

00:57:38.700 --> 00:57:40.900
Now could things get any worse?

00:57:41.300 --> 00:57:43.400
Ho! Ho! Ho!

00:57:48.100 --> 00:57:49.100
Stop screaming.

00:57:49.200 --> 00:57:51.000
That's just what the bomb wants us to do.

00:57:51.200 --> 00:57:52.500
I say do what it tells us.

00:57:53.900 --> 00:57:57.400
Don't worry, a bomb in a case is
just like a head in a jar.

00:58:02.700 --> 00:58:06.400
Oh, Lars, not blowing us up
makes me love you even more.

00:58:06.500 --> 00:58:08.300
Lifesaving goody-goody.

00:58:08.400 --> 00:58:11.800
Well, now that death
has been staved off momentarily,

00:58:11.900 --> 00:58:13.900
let me be the first to say

00:58:14.000 --> 00:58:17.200
congratulations, Leela and Lars.

00:58:19.000 --> 00:58:20.400
- Maid of honor!
- Maid of honor!

00:58:20.500 --> 00:58:21.500
Oh.

00:58:22.100 --> 00:58:24.200
- Oh, that's wonderful.
- I’m so happy.

00:58:24.300 --> 00:58:28.600
I could make you happy, too,
if only you'd give me a chance.

00:58:35.100 --> 00:58:36.300
En garde!

00:58:57.200 --> 00:58:59.600
You've done a wonderful job, Fry.

00:58:59.700 --> 00:59:00.700
When you first started,

00:59:00.800 --> 00:59:02.800
I thought she'd be dead within a narweek,

00:59:02.900 --> 00:59:04.500
which is six days, I believe.

00:59:04.600 --> 00:59:06.100
No, Leelu's a champ.

00:59:06.200 --> 00:59:09.300
She just needed someone
to show her how to eat.

00:59:10.500 --> 00:59:12.500
Now that's the kind
of whale behavioral science

00:59:12.600 --> 00:59:15.000
they don't teach you
in whale behavioral science class.

00:59:15.100 --> 00:59:16.700
So what's up, Dr. Shlivinowitz?

00:59:18.000 --> 00:59:20.200
This is a little hard for me to say, Fry.

00:59:20.500 --> 00:59:21.800
You see, it's...

00:59:21.900 --> 00:59:24.900
It’s time we released Leelu
back into the wild.

00:59:25.600 --> 00:59:28.500
I’m sorry, but the decision is final.

00:59:28.600 --> 00:59:31.700
Plus, we need the tank
for the Loch Ness monster.

00:59:32.900 --> 00:59:34.100
But that turned out to be a log

00:59:34.300 --> 00:59:36.800
with a Halloween mask stapled to it.

00:59:37.900 --> 00:59:40.300
Yes, well, it still draws a crowd.

00:59:41.400 --> 00:59:45.100
I can't let this happen.
She'll never be happy without me.

00:59:55.400 --> 00:59:57.300
I know you're broke and homeless,

00:59:57.400 --> 01:00:00.100
but you still want
a swank wedding reception.

01:00:00.200 --> 01:00:03.700
So I whipped you up
some real nice budget appetizers.

01:00:05.000 --> 01:00:06.100
I can keep these down.

01:00:06.200 --> 01:00:09.000
Okay. That's a big yes on the crud puffs.

01:00:09.100 --> 01:00:11.100
Try the shlimp cocktail.

01:00:11.900 --> 01:00:14.200
There must be some way
I can stop this wedding.

01:00:14.300 --> 01:00:18.000
- What if I steal the wedding ring?
- Already taken care of.

01:00:18.100 --> 01:00:20.400
You think that will be enough
to stop the ceremony?

01:00:20.500 --> 01:00:24.400
Nope. I pulled the old switcheroo,
so they won't even know the difference.

01:00:24.500 --> 01:00:25.600
Wait a minute.

01:00:25.700 --> 01:00:28.800
I think the copy I made
actually cost more than this!

01:00:28.900 --> 01:00:30.800
Cheap, lousy Lars.

01:00:30.900 --> 01:00:35.000
Actually, this is extremely nice.
But I really went all-out on the copy.

01:00:35.100 --> 01:00:37.000
lt was sort of my gift to them.

01:00:38.200 --> 01:00:42.000
I can't let this happen.
She'll never be happy without me.

01:00:48.500 --> 01:00:51.000
It’s not fair. We need each other.

01:00:51.100 --> 01:00:54.900
Fry, you dumb sack.
I don't care about your problems at all.

01:00:56.400 --> 01:00:59.700
- You need your blanket, Mr. Panucci.
- I don't even wanna be here.

01:00:59.800 --> 01:01:01.700
I only came because you wheeled me.

01:01:01.800 --> 01:01:04.000
But if that narwhal means so much to you,

01:01:04.100 --> 01:01:05.600
you gotta do something.

01:01:05.700 --> 01:01:08.200
I know, but I can't just
go chasing after her.

01:01:08.400 --> 01:01:12.000
- That'd be nuts.
- Sometimes you gotta be a little nuts.

01:01:12.100 --> 01:01:15.500
Let me introduce you to my cousin.
He owns a small freighter.

01:01:15.600 --> 01:01:17.800
That's him right behind us.

01:01:17.900 --> 01:01:19.200
Maybe you're right.

01:01:19.300 --> 01:01:22.300
Sir, I’d like to engage your ship
for a trans-Arctic voyage

01:01:22.400 --> 01:01:24.800
to capture a narwhal
and bring it back to my room.

01:01:24.900 --> 01:01:28.600
- The man is nuts, Leroy.
- Professional whale keeper, eh?

01:01:28.700 --> 01:01:31.900
I’ve carried your type before,
and we don't get along.

01:01:32.000 --> 01:01:35.400
Oh, I agree with your values
and your goals and your methods,

01:01:35.500 --> 01:01:38.600
but somehow we just never click
on a personal level.

01:01:38.700 --> 01:01:42.400
I’m not a professional anymore.
Just a narwhal-loving private citizen.

01:01:42.500 --> 01:01:43.800
Then I’m your man.

01:01:43.900 --> 01:01:47.800
We'll take on three barrels
of fresh sausage and sail at dawn.

01:01:56.200 --> 01:01:58.800
Welcome to the wedding!

01:01:58.900 --> 01:02:01.000
It’s a foolproof plan.

01:02:01.100 --> 01:02:04.900
They can't sign the wedding license
if I give them a pen with no ink.

01:02:06.100 --> 01:02:10.800
Yeah, once they try to sign that license,
all hell will break loose.

01:02:11.600 --> 01:02:12.600
Oy vey.

01:02:13.000 --> 01:02:14.100
Go on now, man.

01:02:14.200 --> 01:02:16.500
Don't you know nothing
about zipping up a woman's frock?

01:02:16.600 --> 01:02:19.500
It’s more my thing to zip them down.

01:02:21.100 --> 01:02:24.800
Get your clumsy, muscular hands
off my woman, Barbados.

01:02:24.900 --> 01:02:26.700
Hermes! Your body!

01:02:26.800 --> 01:02:29.200
I always said you were a little backward.

01:02:29.300 --> 01:02:32.000
Well, I always said
you were a little forward.

01:02:32.100 --> 01:02:33.500
With my wife!

01:02:33.600 --> 01:02:36.000
Ooh!

01:02:37.700 --> 01:02:40.200
Consider yourself bird-dogged.

01:02:40.300 --> 01:02:43.100
That's my man! Take a boat, Barbados.

01:02:44.500 --> 01:02:46.500
Brother, you gots to tell that sweet thing

01:02:46.600 --> 01:02:48.800
your time-duplicate body is doomed.

01:02:48.900 --> 01:02:52.100
Tomorrow morning, after the festivities.

01:02:52.200 --> 01:02:53.500
Yow, baby.

01:03:00.700 --> 01:03:04.100
Our little girl is finally getting married.

01:03:04.200 --> 01:03:06.300
And to a normal two-eyed human.

01:03:06.600 --> 01:03:08.000
He's not good enough for her.

01:03:08.100 --> 01:03:10.100
Leela deserves a guy with a dozen eyes.

01:03:10.200 --> 01:03:13.000
Quit trying to fix her up with Fly Mutant.

01:03:16.100 --> 01:03:17.200
Dearly liked,

01:03:17.300 --> 01:03:20.900
we are gathered here
before one or more gods, or fewer,

01:03:21.000 --> 01:03:23.900
to join this couple
in pretty good matrimony.

01:03:24.000 --> 01:03:26.000
lf anyone objects to this union,

01:03:26.100 --> 01:03:29.400
let them speak now
or forever hold their peace,

01:03:29.500 --> 01:03:31.200
or do something else.

01:03:40.000 --> 01:03:42.000
It’s been two years, Fry.

01:03:42.100 --> 01:03:45.600
We've caught 108 narwhals
and set them all free again.

01:03:45.700 --> 01:03:48.500
- None of them were Leelu.
- But all of them were edible.

01:03:48.600 --> 01:03:51.800
Can we at least eat that one?
I’m sick of sausage.

01:03:53.100 --> 01:03:55.700
I’d know
that modified extended tooth anywhere.

01:03:55.900 --> 01:03:57.300
To the boats!

01:03:58.300 --> 01:04:02.100
Leelu! Leelu! It’s me, Fry!

01:04:08.200 --> 01:04:10.100
Oh, I’ve missed you, too, Leelu.

01:04:10.200 --> 01:04:13.700
But we'll never be apart again
because we care too much for each other.

01:04:13.800 --> 01:04:14.900
Fire!

01:04:18.200 --> 01:04:21.200
Now, if the couple will sign
the wedding license.

01:04:41.200 --> 01:04:42.600
I warned him!

01:04:42.700 --> 01:04:46.700
I warned him a time paradox duplicate
is always doomed.

01:04:47.100 --> 01:04:49.800
- What?
- Oh, no, my man.

01:04:49.900 --> 01:04:51.800
He's essentially dead again.

01:04:51.900 --> 01:04:52.900
Relax, ma'am.

01:04:53.000 --> 01:04:56.500
Your husband's original body
will be repaired within one week.

01:04:56.600 --> 01:04:59.500
Not soon enough. Boy needs a daddy.

01:04:59.600 --> 01:05:01.300
Cruel runnings, man.

01:05:04.200 --> 01:05:07.500
- Woopsy-doopsy, poopsy.
- Well, let's get on with it.

01:05:07.600 --> 01:05:10.000
Don't let my doomed body
and my doomed marriage

01:05:10.100 --> 01:05:11.600
stand in the way of your happiness.

01:05:11.700 --> 01:05:13.200
No, it's not right.

01:05:13.300 --> 01:05:16.800
We don't want our happy day tainted
by misfortune and tragedy, do we?

01:05:16.900 --> 01:05:19.600
- I’m okay with it.
- No, it's not right.

01:05:19.700 --> 01:05:20.900
The wedding is off.

01:05:23.400 --> 01:05:25.000
Oh, my goodness!

01:05:27.400 --> 01:05:29.400
Finally, a happy ending.

01:05:37.900 --> 01:05:41.400
And now it's time for
Everybody Loves Hypnotoad.

01:05:46.700 --> 01:05:50.300
Even in a depression,
the entertainment industry thrives.

01:05:57.500 --> 01:05:58.800
Are you okay, Leela?

01:05:58.900 --> 01:06:00.800
Yeah, I’m just a little down

01:06:00.900 --> 01:06:03.700
'cause the only man
I’ll ever love left me at the altar.

01:06:03.800 --> 01:06:06.800
- Plus I live in a dumpster.
- You stay out of my dumpster.

01:06:08.100 --> 01:06:10.700
We interrupt this
episode ofEverybody Loves Hypnotoad

01:06:10.800 --> 01:06:14.500
to bring you a speciaI address
from Earth President Nixon.

01:06:14.600 --> 01:06:17.000
Please, Hypnotoad, it's beyond my controI.

01:06:17.100 --> 01:06:19.300
No! Don't make me kill myseIf!

01:06:21.000 --> 01:06:22.800
My fellow Earthicans,

01:06:22.900 --> 01:06:26.200
I've just received some really great news.

01:06:26.300 --> 01:06:27.400
I’m about to close a deal

01:06:27.500 --> 01:06:30.500
that will allow us to buy Earth back
from the scammers.

01:06:31.700 --> 01:06:33.500
That'll teach those scammers and me.

01:06:33.600 --> 01:06:35.500
Just when things looked darkest,

01:06:35.600 --> 01:06:38.800
I received an e-mail
from the Andromeda Galaxy.

01:06:38.900 --> 01:06:42.900
lt seems we've won their
quadrillion-dollar family sweepstakes.

01:06:44.200 --> 01:06:45.200
Oh, Lord.

01:06:45.300 --> 01:06:46.800
And all I had to do was hand over

01:06:46.900 --> 01:06:49.800
our last remaining land
and water as collateral.

01:06:49.900 --> 01:06:50.900
So assuming all goes...

01:06:52.200 --> 01:06:54.200
What's that, Agnew? A telegram?

01:06:57.800 --> 01:07:01.200
There... Seems to have been some...

01:07:01.300 --> 01:07:02.800
We've been scammed again, people.

01:07:02.900 --> 01:07:06.900
Prepare to evacuate Earth.
I mean, New Scamedonia.

01:07:09.900 --> 01:07:13.500
Na-na-na-na
Na-na-na-na

01:07:13.800 --> 01:07:15.500
Hey, hey, hey

01:07:15.600 --> 01:07:17.500
We took your stuff

01:07:17.600 --> 01:07:19.700
All aboard for Neptune!

01:07:19.800 --> 01:07:22.300
Oh, I don't want to go to Neptune.

01:07:22.400 --> 01:07:24.700
I’ll be cold and heavy.

01:07:26.900 --> 01:07:29.000
Thanks for the planet, suckers.

01:07:53.600 --> 01:07:57.400
It’s so cold, my processor is running
at peak efficiency.

01:07:57.500 --> 01:07:59.300
What are you, a whining machine?

01:07:59.400 --> 01:08:02.400
lf you want to worry about something,
worry about the yetis.

01:08:02.500 --> 01:08:03.900
Yetis?

01:08:05.700 --> 01:08:07.900
Oh, yetis.

01:08:08.000 --> 01:08:11.500
Amy, you speak yeti.
What are they saying?

01:08:11.600 --> 01:08:14.800
I’m not sure, but it sounds
like something to do with...

01:08:14.900 --> 01:08:17.700
''Assaulting the interlopers.''

01:08:24.100 --> 01:08:27.100
Don't mess with me,
you ice-crapping snow-honkies.

01:08:27.300 --> 01:08:29.000
I just got dumped.

01:08:32.000 --> 01:08:36.100
Sweet yeti of the Serengeti,
she's gone crazy eddie in the head-y.

01:08:46.600 --> 01:08:48.700
- Is that normal?
- No.

01:08:48.800 --> 01:08:51.000
Perhaps if we were to cook
and eat her slightly...

01:08:51.100 --> 01:08:52.200
Leave her alone.

01:08:52.300 --> 01:08:54.900
She just needs me to cheer her up.

01:08:55.000 --> 01:08:57.100
Wanna sword fight, girl?

01:09:02.100 --> 01:09:04.800
That male narwhal seems
to be upsetting her.

01:09:04.900 --> 01:09:08.500
Get us out of here, Captain.
Full fast ahead.

01:09:08.600 --> 01:09:10.500
Damn whale keepers.

01:09:22.900 --> 01:09:25.800
Santa! We forgot he's based on Neptune.

01:09:25.900 --> 01:09:28.700
Ho! Ho! Ho!

01:09:29.900 --> 01:09:32.400
Oh, my heart's not in it.

01:09:32.500 --> 01:09:36.100
I’m too depressed
for murder and mayhem.

01:09:37.200 --> 01:09:40.000
Try some antidepressants.
They're Gummi.

01:09:40.100 --> 01:09:41.300
What happened, Santa?

01:09:41.400 --> 01:09:44.200
The scammers cheated me
out of my naughty list

01:09:44.300 --> 01:09:46.200
to use for telemarketing.

01:09:46.300 --> 01:09:49.300
Can you imagine the harm
they could do with that information?

01:09:49.400 --> 01:09:51.300
I wanted to do that harm.

01:09:51.400 --> 01:09:53.700
That's it. They've gone too far.

01:09:53.800 --> 01:09:57.600
No more running and hiding.
It’s time to fight back.

01:09:57.700 --> 01:10:00.200
Now, let's not resort to violence, Leela.

01:10:00.300 --> 01:10:04.400
We're fighting back and you're helping us,
you fat holiday idiot.

01:10:05.800 --> 01:10:06.800
That hurt.

01:10:06.900 --> 01:10:09.000
You're on the naughty list.

01:10:18.900 --> 01:10:21.300
So that's our proposal napkin,
Mr. President.

01:10:21.400 --> 01:10:24.900
We have just enough people
and ships to mount a ragtag attack.

01:10:25.000 --> 01:10:26.000
You wish, missy.

01:10:26.100 --> 01:10:28.200
Dog-danged scammers used
our money to build

01:10:28.300 --> 01:10:31.600
a fleet of remote-controlled,
solid-gold Death Stars.

01:10:33.100 --> 01:10:36.600
Ooh! I’d take one of those
with a side of chili fries.

01:10:36.700 --> 01:10:38.500
We're hopelessly outgunned.

01:10:38.600 --> 01:10:41.400
The force is with us, but that's about it.

01:10:41.700 --> 01:10:45.900
But we have access
to a huge manufacturing complex.

01:10:46.300 --> 01:10:48.700
I brought the eIves back from vacation

01:10:48.800 --> 01:10:51.300
Chained them up
and called my holiday friends

01:10:51.400 --> 01:10:52.500
Kwanzabot

01:10:52.600 --> 01:10:53.800
And the Chanukah zombie

01:10:53.900 --> 01:10:56.600
Three mad, wise men
Bearing murder and frankincense

01:10:56.700 --> 01:10:58.100
- Damn you
- Shut up

01:10:58.200 --> 01:11:01.400
Now fetch those bunnies by the armfuI

01:11:01.500 --> 01:11:03.300
- Says who?
- Says me

01:11:03.400 --> 01:11:05.900
NapaIm makes them
slightIy more harmfuI

01:11:06.000 --> 01:11:08.000
No one here goes near that door

01:11:08.200 --> 01:11:10.400
This toyshop's going to war

01:11:11.200 --> 01:11:13.100
TaImud says
'"Be sIow to anger'"

01:11:13.200 --> 01:11:16.000
Low-down scammers got me seeing red

01:11:16.100 --> 01:11:18.100
Got my TIE fighter out of the hangar

01:11:18.200 --> 01:11:21.200
Jump back, Jack
'Cause I'm Jewish and I'm undead

01:11:21.300 --> 01:11:23.100
Ten hut!

01:11:23.200 --> 01:11:26.000
DreidI, dreidI
I made it out of bIasting cIay

01:11:26.100 --> 01:11:27.100
You're nuts

01:11:27.200 --> 01:11:30.500
And when it's dry and ready
For mercy they will pay

01:11:30.600 --> 01:11:32.500
I can't wait eight nights or more

01:11:32.600 --> 01:11:34.700
This zombie's going to war

01:11:34.800 --> 01:11:37.300
Check, check it out
Kwanzabot in the NeptizzIe-hizzIe

01:11:37.400 --> 01:11:40.000
With my inhuman beat box
Busy building missiles

01:11:40.100 --> 01:11:42.600
They're guided by these
cute dancing fairy figures

01:11:42.800 --> 01:11:44.900
CarefuI, littIe eIf
That's proximity-triggered

01:11:45.000 --> 01:11:47.300
I'm fighting back for Kwanza
So the children won't miss it

01:11:47.400 --> 01:11:49.800
I'm confused about its meaning
But I know it when they dis it

01:11:49.900 --> 01:11:51.000
- So, Santa
- Yeah, K?

01:11:51.100 --> 01:11:52.200
- CZ?
- Hey, hey

01:11:52.300 --> 01:11:55.200
Let's sIay them pimps
Come on, pimp my sIeigh

01:11:55.300 --> 01:11:57.300
Easy with that toy artillery

01:11:57.400 --> 01:12:00.200
Torgo's powder's deadIy but unstabIe

01:12:00.300 --> 01:12:03.100
- Can they sue for liability?
- Certainly not!

01:12:03.200 --> 01:12:05.300
Use as much as you are abIe

01:12:05.400 --> 01:12:06.900
This bites

01:12:07.000 --> 01:12:09.900
You signed away your rights
when you were hired

01:12:10.100 --> 01:12:11.200
- Now, Iet's fight
- Let's fight

01:12:11.300 --> 01:12:12.300
Okay!

01:12:12.400 --> 01:12:14.800
Chestnuts roasting, I'm gonna open fire

